true\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.18em; margin-bottom: -0.248em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-h class=\"mjx-c2013\" style=\"width: 0.583em;\"><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext></mjx-stretchy-h></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D706 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-base></mjx-mover><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>λ</mi><mo accent=\"true\">―</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mtext>i</mtext><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> \n the complex conjugate of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"460\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D706 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> Hence, to construct the matrix <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"461\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assis